do_2 = "Extend apps/explorer/ui/token/TokenTransfer/TokenTransfer.spec.tsx:57 with a declared async function tokenTransferLiveUpdatesFollowDisplayPage registered as a Vitest test: render the real TokenTransfer with its production pagination and socket hooks, select 25 rows, and exercise next, previous and row-selection reset; with at least two display pages backed by server page 1, assert that the token channel subscription and both desktop/mobile notices are active only on display page 1, that incoming transfer counts stop on later display pages and resume on return, and that placeholder/error states still disable the channel; assert actual subscription lifecycle and rendered notices without replacing the pagination or socket hooks."
